# 自定义分流：补充 AI 服务域名并指定 AI 策略；国内 AI 服务明确直连。
# 修改本文件并推送到 main 后，Quantumult X 将按资源更新间隔重新获取。

# Grok / xAI；不包含整个 X / Twitter
host-suffix, grok.com, AI
host-suffix, x.ai, AI

# AI 搜索、编程与模型平台
host-suffix, perplexity.ai, AI
host-suffix, perplexity.com, AI

# Cursor：主站、API、下载更新资源、云端环境及登录入口
host-suffix, cursor.com, AI
host-suffix, cursor.sh, AI
host-suffix, cursorapi.com, AI
host-suffix, cursor-cdn.com, AI
host-suffix, cursorvm.com, AI
host, accounts.spacex.ai, AI

# 模型与服务平台
host-suffix, mistral.ai, AI
host-suffix, poe.com, AI
# Hugging Face：主站、模型下载存储/CDN 和 Spaces 托管应用
host-suffix, huggingface.co, AI
host-suffix, hf.co, AI
host-suffix, hf.space, AI
host-suffix, openrouter.ai, AI
host-suffix, character.ai, AI
# Cohere：主站和 API（api.cohere.ai）
host-suffix, cohere.com, AI
host-suffix, cohere.ai, AI
host-suffix, groq.com, AI

# AI 应用
host-suffix, meta.ai, AI
host-suffix, midjourney.com, AI
# Dify：云平台与发布的 WebApp
host-suffix, dify.ai, AI
host-suffix, udify.app, AI
# Manus：主站与 API（api.manus.ai）
host-suffix, manus.im, AI
host-suffix, manus.ai, AI
host-suffix, you.com, AI
host-suffix, elevenlabs.io, AI

# Google AI Studio / NotebookLM；其余 Gemini 域名由上游 Gemini.list 处理
host, aistudio.google.com, AI
host-suffix, notebook.google.com, AI
host-suffix, notebooklm.google.com, AI
host-suffix, notebooklm.google, AI
host, notebooklm-pa.googleapis.com, AI

# Claude；上游 Claude.list 尚未包含 claude.com / claudeusercontent.com
host-suffix, claude.com, AI
host-suffix, claudeusercontent.com, AI

# 国内 AI 直连
host-suffix, deepseek.com, direct
host-suffix, kimi.ai, direct
host-suffix, kimi.com, direct
